#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:130
msgid "`DiagnosticSpec`"
msgstr "`DiagnosticSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:144
msgid "`DiagnosticSpec` remains read-only: `writes_state` must be the exact boolean `False`, even with a `feedback_port`. That declaration never authorizes a state write. Managed feedback has a separate existing non-diagnostic owner: `relic.coupling.observation.state_feedback.ObservationStateFeedbackFunctor`. It forms the direct-observation innovation `d=y-x`, checks `abs(d)/sqrt(B+R)<=nu_max`, and proposes `x_a=x+B/(B+R)*d` as a `REPLACE` update through StateManager. The target SCM must authorize `observation_state_feedback`; its gain, increment, and analysis variance are diagnostics on the observation route. Tower/support observation operators remain read-only. This scalar identity-observation binding is not a general assimilation algorithm or authorization to mutate diagnostics."
msgstr "`DiagnosticSpec` 保持只读：`writes_state` 必须是精确的布尔值 `False`，即使带有 `feedback_port` 也是如此。该声明绝不授权状态写入。受管 feedback 有一个独立的、已存在的非 diagnostic owner：`relic.coupling.observation.state_feedback.ObservationStateFeedbackFunctor`。它构造直接观测 innovation `d=y-x`，检查 `abs(d)/sqrt(B+R)<=nu_max`，并通过 StateManager 将 `x_a=x+B/(B+R)*d` 作为 `REPLACE` update 提出。目标 SCM 必须授权 `observation_state_feedback`；其 gain、increment 和 analysis variance 是观测路由上的 diagnostics。Tower/support 观测算子保持只读。这一标量恒等观测绑定不是通用的同化算法，也不是修改 diagnostics 的授权。"

