#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:221
msgid "The method evaluates:"
msgstr "该方法计算："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:223
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"D_{k+1,h} D_{k,h} = 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"D_{k+1,h} D_{k,h} = 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:227
msgid "It returns residual norms keyed by the composed degree pair. A negative, non-finite, or non-numeric tolerance raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "返回以 composed degree pair 为 key 的 residual norm。负数、non-finite 或非 numeric tolerance 会抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:230
msgid "With `strict=True`, the bundle must contain the complete derivative sequence and all support tensors on one device. Boundary masks must be binary, orientations must be `-1` or `1`, and primal and dual measures must be positive. Missing data, invalid shapes, non-finite values, or residuals above `tol` raise `ValueError`."
msgstr "当 `strict=True` 时，bundle 必须包含完整 derivative sequence，且所有 support Tensor 位于同一 device。Boundary mask 必须为 binary，orientation 必须为 `-1` 或 `1`，primal 和 dual measure 必须为正。缺失数据、无效 shape、non-finite value 或高于 `tol` 的 residual 会抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:236
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Strict validation also requires integer-valued incidence within the exact integer range of the dtype, `D[0] @ 1 = 0`, `0 <= tol < 0.5`, no boundary mark on top-degree cells, and a boundary subcomplex closed under the boundary operator. Non-strict validation checks only the consecutive `D` pairs actually supplied. `coboundary_matrix(k)`, `boundary_matrix(k)` (the transpose view of the unique `D` owner), `trace_matrix(k)`, and `typed_stokes_audit(alpha, chain)` are also public; the Stokes audit evaluates one pairing $\\langle D_k\\alpha,c\\rangle-\\langle\\alpha,\\partial_{k+1}c\\rangle$ and does not prove mesh provenance or boundary-mask completeness."
msgstr "strict 验证还要求：关联系数为整数值且位于该 dtype 可精确表示的整数范围内，`D[0] @ 1 = 0`，`0 <= tol < 0.5`，最高阶 cell 上没有边界标记，并且边界子复形在边界算子下封闭。非 strict 验证只检查实际提供的相邻 `D` 对。`coboundary_matrix(k)`、`boundary_matrix(k)`（唯一 `D` owner 的转置视图）、`trace_matrix(k)` 和 `typed_stokes_audit(alpha, chain)` 也是公开接口；Stokes 审计只求值一个配对 $\\langle D_k\\alpha,c\\rangle-\\langle\\alpha,\\partial_{k+1}c\\rangle$，不能证明网格来源或边界掩码的完整性。"

