#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:311
msgid "A strict passive operator must be square, declare `role` (`metric_hodge` or `material_hodge`) and `definiteness`, and use tolerances not above `sqrt(machine epsilon)` for its dtype. Every passive square matrix must be symmetric and positive semidefinite within tolerance. A strict `metric_hodge` must be `positive_definite`; a strict `positive_semidefinite` operator must be a `material_hodge` with a linearly independent `kernel_basis` whose width equals the numerical nullity and whose image `matrix @ kernel_basis` vanishes within `kernel_rtol`. Violations raise `ValueError`. These checks concern the supplied matrix value, not mesh provenance or refinement convergence."
msgstr "strict 无源算子必须为方阵，声明 `role`（`metric_hodge` 或 `material_hodge`）和 `definiteness`，并且所用容差不得高于其 dtype 的 `sqrt(machine epsilon)`。每个无源方阵都必须在容差内对称且半正定。strict `metric_hodge` 必须为 `positive_definite`；strict `positive_semidefinite` 算子必须是 `material_hodge`，并带有线性无关的 `kernel_basis`，其列数等于数值零化度，且其像 `matrix @ kernel_basis` 在 `kernel_rtol` 内为零。违反这些条件时抛出 `ValueError`。这些检查针对所提供的矩阵值，而不涉及网格来源或网格加密收敛性。"

