#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:377
msgid "Methods and distance helper:"
msgstr "方法与距离辅助函数："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:412
msgid "`apply(cochain)` requires `cochain.space == self.source` (`ValueError` otherwise) and evaluates $(M x) \\cdot u$ into a `TypedCochain` on `self.target` preserving `time` and `provenance`. `compose(first)` forms $M_2 \\circ M_1$ when `first.target == self.source`, multiplying matrices in `float64` and multiplying `unit_factor` values. `preserves_ledger(...)` checks $\\max \\lvert C_{\\mathrm{target}} (u M) - C_{\\mathrm{source}} \\rvert \\le \\tau$, resolving `validation.iphs.chain_map_ledger_tolerance` from `get_global_manager()` when `tolerance is None`. `equals(other)` tests exact equivalence of spaces, `unit_factor`, and `float64` matrices, whereas `distance(other)` returns the operator 2-norm $\\lVert u_1 M_1 - u_2 M_2 \\rVert_2$ on identical spaces and `close_within(first, second, epsilon)` evaluates that reflexive, symmetric, non-transitive distance bound."
msgstr "`apply(cochain)` 要求 `cochain.space == self.source`（不满足则抛出 `ValueError`），并计算 $(M x) \\cdot u$ 以在 `self.target` 上生成保留 `time` 与 `provenance` 的 `TypedCochain`。`compose(first)` 在 `first.target == self.source` 时构造复合映射 $M_2 \\circ M_1$，在 `float64` 精度下执行矩阵乘法并将 `unit_factor` 相乘。`preserves_ledger(...)` 检查 $\\max \\lvert C_{\\mathrm{target}} (u M) - C_{\\mathrm{source}} \\rvert \\le \\tau$，当 `tolerance is None` 时通过 `get_global_manager()` 解析 `validation.iphs.chain_map_ledger_tolerance`。`equals(other)` 检验空间、`unit_factor` 与 `float64` 矩阵的精确等价性；`distance(other)` 在相同空间上返回算子 2-范数 $\\lVert u_1 M_1 - u_2 M_2 \\rVert_2$，`close_within(first, second, epsilon)` 则评估该满足自反性与对称性、不具传递性的距离界。"

