msgstr "要求提供亲和势、守恒矩阵以及完整的开放字段。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:837
msgid "Accepted open-system routes are `boundary_export`, `managed_export`, `diagnostic_residual`, `port`, and `observation`."
msgstr "接受的 open-system route 为 `boundary_export`、`managed_export`、`diagnostic_residual`、`port` 和 `observation`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:840
msgid "Invalid names, empty bases, matrix/rate shape mismatches, and invalid route names raise `ValueError`. If a conservation matrix is supplied and fails while `strict_conservation=True`, the function raises `ValueError`. Without a matrix, `require_conservation_matrix=True` raises only when no open-system route is declared."
msgstr "无效名称、空 basis、matrix/rate shape 不匹配以及无效 route name 会抛出 `ValueError`。如果提供的 conservation matrix 失败且 `strict_conservation=True`，函数会抛出 `ValueError`。未提供 matrix 时，仅当没有声明 open-system route，`require_conservation_matrix=True` 才会抛出异常。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:846
msgid "Supplying any point-audit input requires a non-empty `conservation_matrix` whose $C_hN_h=0$ check passes, independent of `strict_conservation`. The optional point audit checks the aggregate affinity power $\\sum_jA_jr_j\\ge-\\mathrm{rtol}\\sum_j\\lvert A_jr_j\\rvert$ under `affinity_sign_convention=\"affinity_times_rate_nonnegative\"`; this is a power check, and no temperature or entropy rate is inferred. With an open route it checks $C_hq_{\\mathrm{open}}=$ `open_ledger_rate` without adding $q_{\\mathrm{open}}$ to the derivative; the time-integrated no-double-count proof remains `[N]`. Open fields without an open route raise `ValueError`. Results are stored in `thermodynamic_audit` and `open_system_audit`."
msgstr "只要提供任一单点审计输入，就要求提供非空的 `conservation_matrix`，且其 $C_hN_h=0$ 检查必须通过，这与 `strict_conservation` 无关。可选的单点审计在 `affinity_sign_convention=\"affinity_times_rate_nonnegative\"` 下检查聚合亲和势功率 $\\sum_jA_jr_j\\ge-\\mathrm{rtol}\\sum_j\\lvert A_jr_j\\rvert$；这是功率检查，不推断任何温度或熵速率。存在开放路由时，它检查 $C_hq_{\\mathrm{open}}=$ `open_ledger_rate`，但不将 $q_{\\mathrm{open}}$ 加到导数中；时间积分意义上不重复计数的证明仍为 `[N]`。没有开放路由却提供开放字段时抛出 `ValueError`。结果存储在 `thermodynamic_audit` 和 `open_system_audit` 中。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:857
msgid "This function is a low-level compatibility helper: an allowed open route may replace `conservation_matrix` only when the caller explicitly selects that policy. Graph strict `reaction_network_check` is stronger. Its closed and open payloads both provide a non-empty `C_h` and prove `C_h N_h=0`; an open payload then adds route, exchange vector, ledger-rate vector, units, and `C_h q_open=ledger_rate`. Payload-local `strict=false` cannot weaken that outer Graph contract."
msgstr "该函数是一个低层兼容 helper：仅当 caller 显式选择该策略时，允许的开放路由才可替代 `conservation_matrix`。Graph strict `reaction_network_check` 更强。其闭合与开放 payload 都提供非空的 `C_h` 并证明 `C_h N_h=0`；开放 payload 随后还添加路由、交换向量、账本速率向量、单位以及 `C_h q_open=ledger_rate`。Payload 局部的 `strict=false` 不能削弱该外层 Graph contract。"

