#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:912
msgid "`port_interconnection_C` must be skew-symmetric. `port_dissipation_D` must be symmetric positive semidefinite and contributes only to the energy resistance `R`, producing `-G D G^T e_H` in the dissipative-pH drift. It never augments GENERIC `M`; `formulation=\"generic\"` together with `port_dissipation_D` raises `ValueError`. Strict assembly requires at least one contribution and a traceable runtime owner or source node. `required_level` is applied only when `validate=True`. The assembler resolves `None` for `skew_tol`, `psd_tol`, and `degeneracy_tol` from `validation.iphs.skew_tolerance`, `validation.iphs.psd_tolerance`, and `validation.iphs.degeneracy_tolerance` before it checks `C` and `D`, and passes the Poisson-field arguments unchanged to `IPHSStructureSpec`, where `jacobi_tol=None` reads `validation.iphs.jacobi_tolerance`."
msgstr "`port_interconnection_C` 必须反对称。`port_dissipation_D` 必须对称半正定，且仅贡献于能量阻力 `R`，在耗散 pH 漂移中产生 `-G D G^T e_H`。它绝不增广 GENERIC `M`；`formulation=\"generic\"` 与 `port_dissipation_D` 同时使用会抛出 `ValueError`。严格组装至少需要一个贡献项及可追溯的运行时所有者或来源节点。仅当 `validate=True` 时应用 `required_level`。组装器在检查 `C` 和 `D` 之前，分别从 `validation.iphs.skew_tolerance`、`validation.iphs.psd_tolerance` 和 `validation.iphs.degeneracy_tolerance` 解析 `skew_tol`、`psd_tol` 和 `degeneracy_tol` 的 `None` 值，并将 Poisson 场参数原样传给 `IPHSStructureSpec`；其中 `jacobi_tol=None` 时读取 `validation.iphs.jacobi_tolerance`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:925
msgid "Contributions are embedded by exact `state_vars` name: contributions naming the same variable act on one coordinate, and different names are never aliased or unit-converted. Declared energy/entropy gradient contributions are summed coordinatewise; the assembler constructs no `H`, `E`, or `S` functional, effort, affinity, or shared-state equivalence. It has no `storage_kind` argument, so the Level 4 reaction pairing needs a directly constructed `IPHSStructureSpec`."
msgstr "贡献项按精确的 `state_vars` 名称嵌入：同名变量的贡献作用于同一坐标，不同名称之间不作别名映射或单位转换。声明的能量/熵梯度贡献逐坐标相加；组装器不构造 `H`、`E` 或 `S` 泛函、势变量、亲和力或共享状态等价关系。它没有 `storage_kind` 参数，因此第 4 级反应配对需要直接构造 `IPHSStructureSpec`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:933
msgid "Every argument is keyword-only; `poisson_operator` and `reaction_representation` have no default and are required. The graph-metadata compile path (`iphs_assembly` in graph metadata) forwards `poisson_operator` and `reaction_representation`, both required (a declaration without one raises `ValueError` naming the missing field), and, when declared, `poisson_field`, `poisson_domain`, `jacobi_tol`, `skew_tol`, `psd_tol`, and `degeneracy_tol`. `poisson_field` must be an importable `package.module:attribute` reference, resolved at compile time to a callable; `poisson_domain` must be a non-empty list of numeric state vectors of equal length and becomes a float64 `(m, n)` tensor. These three keys are accepted only with `poisson_operator` `constant_field` or `state_field`. A declared tolerance must be a number (a null, string, bool, or list is refused); its range is checked by the structure. An omitted tolerance selects the ParameterManager default. A refused declaration makes the IPHS assembly audit report `passed=False` with the reason. A `state_field` structure can therefore be compiled from graph metadata."
msgstr "所有参数均仅限关键字；`poisson_operator` 和 `reaction_representation` 无默认值，必须提供。图元数据编译路径（图元数据中的 `iphs_assembly`）转发两个必需项 `poisson_operator` 和 `reaction_representation`（声明缺失任一项时抛出 `ValueError` 并指出字段），以及已声明的 `poisson_field`、`poisson_domain`、`jacobi_tol`、`skew_tol`、`psd_tol` 和 `degeneracy_tol`。`poisson_field` 必须是可导入的 `package.module:attribute` 引用，在编译时解析为可调用对象；`poisson_domain` 必须是非空、等长的数值状态向量列表，并转换为 float64 `(m, n)` 张量。这三个键仅在 `poisson_operator` 为 `constant_field` 或 `state_field` 时接受。声明的容差必须是数值（拒绝 null、字符串、布尔值或列表），其范围由结构检查。省略容差时采用 ParameterManager 默认值。声明被拒绝时，IPHS 组装审计报告 `passed=False` 及原因。因此可从图元数据编译 `state_field` 结构。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:950
msgid "Invalid contributions raise `TypeError`; duplicate or unknown state variables, shape mismatches, missing `G`, or invalid port matrices raise `ValueError`."
msgstr "无效 contribution 会抛出 `TypeError`；重复或未知 state variable、shape 不匹配、缺少 `G` 或 port matrix 无效会抛出 `ValueError`。"

