msgstr "IPHS equivalence certificates（IPHS 等价证书）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:965
msgid "Implementation: `relic.computation.operators.iphs_certificate.IPHSEquivalenceCertificate`"
msgstr "实现：`relic.computation.operators.iphs_certificate.IPHSEquivalenceCertificate`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:968
msgid "The certificate is the only owner of the IPHS standardization level. In the packaged repository, all `90` concrete scientific `Functor` classes (`37` `BiologicalProcessFunctor`, `27` `TransportMechanismFunctor`, `14` `PhysicalFieldFunctor`, and `12` `ScaleCouplingFunctor`; `0` uncertified) carry validated YAML certificates, totaling `92` certificates: `90` primary class certificates distributed across Levels `0` through `5` as `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 0 / 0` (including the two certified Level `2` `[I]` runtime-bound stochastic Functors `OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` and `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`), plus `2` constructor-scoped runtime-point certificates (`constructor_selection` at Levels `4` and `5`) yielding `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 1 / 1` across all `92` certificates."
msgstr "该证书是互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）标准化等级的唯一权威归属。在随包代码库中，全部 `90` 个具体科学 `Functor` 类（`BiologicalProcessFunctor` `37` 个、`TransportMechanismFunctor` `27` 个、`PhysicalFieldFunctor` `14` 个、`ScaleCouplingFunctor` `12` 个；未认证数为 `0`）均附带经校验的 YAML 证书，总计 `92` 份：其中 `90` 份类主证书在 Level `0` 至 Level `5` 上的分布为 `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 0 / 0`（含两个已认证的 Level `2` `[I]` 运行时绑定随机 Functor `OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` 与 `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`），外加 `2` 份限定构造参数的运行时点证书（分别位于 Level `4` 与 Level `5` 的 `constructor_selection`），使全部 `92` 份证书总计分布为 `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 1 / 1`。"

