#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1277
msgid "The manifest ignores unknown top-level fields. It raises Pydantic validation errors for invalid construction. `parse_manifest()` translates YAML and schema errors into `ManifestError`."
msgstr "Manifest 会忽略未知的 top-level field。构造无效时抛出 Pydantic validation error。`parse_manifest()` 将 YAML 和 schema error 转换为 `ManifestError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1281
msgid "Current implementation limits:"
msgstr "当前实现限制："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1283
msgid "`min_relic_version` is format-validated but is not compared with the running RELIC version by the loader."
msgstr "`min_relic_version` 会进行格式验证，但 loader 不会将其与正在运行的 RELIC version 比较。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1285
msgid "`DependencyDeclaration` is not a package installer or a second dependency scheduler."
msgstr "`DependencyDeclaration` 不是 package installer 或第二套 dependency scheduler。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1288
msgid "`parse_manifest()`"
msgstr "`parse_manifest()`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1294
msgid "`path` may be an extension root or `relic_extension.yaml`. Missing files raise `FileNotFoundError`. Invalid YAML, read failures, non-mapping payloads, and schema failures raise `ManifestError`."
msgstr "`path` 可以是 extension root 或 `relic_extension.yaml`。文件缺失时抛出 `FileNotFoundError`。无效 YAML、读取失败、非 mapping payload 和 schema failure 会抛出 `ManifestError`。"

