#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1562
msgid "Loading an already loaded or retired host raises `PluginLifecycleError`."
msgstr "加载已加载或已退役的 host 会抛出 `PluginLifecycleError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1571
msgid "Retirement rejects new native calls while calls already in flight continue. `drain` waits for their completion. `unload` releases the library only after draining; a timeout returns `released=False` and `drained=False`, retaining a retired host whose unload can be retried. A repeated unload after successful release is rejected. `reload` drains and reopens the same path. Read-only `state`, `loaded`, `inflight_calls`, `completed_calls`, `abi`, and `receipts` expose the current lifecycle and its outcomes. Returning from a C entry point is the completion signal available to this ABI."
msgstr "退役会拒绝新的 native 调用，而已在进行中的调用继续执行。`drain` 等待这些调用完成。`unload` 仅在 drain 完成后才释放该库；超时则返回 `released=False` 与 `drained=False`，并保留一个可重试 unload 的已退役 host。成功释放后重复 unload 会被拒绝。`reload` 会 drain 并重新打开同一路径。只读的 `state`、`loaded`、`inflight_calls`、`completed_calls`、`abi` 和 `receipts` 暴露当前生命周期及其结果。从 C 入口点返回是该 ABI 可用的完成信号。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1587
msgid "Both require a loaded plugin. A nonzero plugin return code, empty JSON, or an unloaded host raises `RuntimeError`. Invalid JSON propagates its parser error; a non-object JSON payload raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "两者都要求已加载 plugin。非零 plugin return code、空 JSON 或未加载 host 会抛出 `RuntimeError`。无效 JSON 会传播 parser error；非 object JSON payload 会抛出 `ValueError`。"

