msgstr "加载 library、验证 probe manifest、negotiates host capability、验证 agreed manifest、存储 port，并重建 Functor metadata。Manifest 无效或 spatial scale 无法解析时抛出 `ValueError`；native host failure 会继续传播。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1650
msgid "The adapter does not override `get_dependencies()`. It inherits the `ScaleCouplingFunctor` bridge default, which returns the names declared on the instance through `config[\"dependencies\"]`, `set_dependencies(...)` or `add_dependency(...)`, in declaration order and without duplicates. The list is empty only when nothing is declared. When `GraphExecutor` builds a node from a graph step that has input links, it calls `set_dependencies(...)` with the sorted source-node names of those links. This replaces the earlier instance list, so the graph links become the adapter's dependencies."
msgstr "适配器不重写 `get_dependencies()`，而是继承 `ScaleCouplingFunctor` 桥接类的默认行为：按声明顺序返回实例通过 `config[\"dependencies\"]`、`set_dependencies(...)` 或 `add_dependency(...)` 声明的名称，并去重。仅在没有任何声明时列表才为空。`GraphExecutor` 根据含输入链接的图步骤构造节点时，会将这些链接的源节点名称排序后传给 `set_dependencies(...)`，替换先前实例列表，因此图链接成为适配器的依赖。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/scientific_structure_extensions.md:1668
